  },
  "source": "https://doi.org/10.1126/science.aap9559",
  "reference": "Vosoughi S, Roy D, Aral S. (2018). The spread of true and false news online. Science, 359(6380), 1146-1151. DOI: 10.1126/science.aap9559. Also: Lazer DMJ, et al. (2018). The science of fake news. Science, 359(6380), 1094-1096.",
